{"items":[{"str":"who wants to be a woman and the one who wants to stay a man. The one","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"who wants to be a woman becomes a killer each time the man becomes","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,635],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"sexually aroused as a man (the framework is","dir":"ltr","width":196,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,352,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"heterosexist","dir":"ltr","width":55,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,356,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,411,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":"throughout,","dir":"ltr","width":54,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,414,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"that is, it equates heterosexual desire with “being a man”). The problem,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"says the movie, is when you cannot make up your mind which you are or","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,593],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"want to be. At the end of the movie, the biomedical technology of sex","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,579],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"change operations is described luridly to the teenage male heroic pro-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tagonist of the film by the gutsy call girl who also solves the mystery. The","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"audience is supposed to regard this procedure as monstrous.","dir":"ltr","width":262,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"In","dir":"ltr","width":10,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,178,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"The Silence of the Lambs","dir":"ltr","width":102,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,181,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":", the message has become more subtle: the","dir":"ltr","width":185,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,283,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"problem is not authentic transsexualism or gender dysphoria, but the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,509],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"mistake of thinking that you want to be a woman when you are—and re-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,495],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ally wish to remain—a man. This film, in turn, confuses the categories of","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,481],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the gay person and the transsexual and suggests to us (through the name","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"of the dog, Precious, and through the history of the killer and his male","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"lover) that being gay, if you are a man, is the same as wanting to be a","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,439],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"woman. Although the film hides behind the “mistake” that confuses the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,425],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"killer Jamie Gum (“Buffalo Bill”), it nevertheless invites our","dir":"ltr","width":259,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,415,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"voyeuristic","dir":"ltr","width":50,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,418,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,397],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"fascination with sexual subcultures: Jamie’s dressing up, his hiding his","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,397],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"penis between his legs and his mirror-image","dir":"ltr","width":204,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,360,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"drag queen","dir":"ltr","width":54,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,365,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,419,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":"poses, his","dir":"ltr","width":43,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,425,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"makeup, and of course, most obviously, his nipple ring all conjure up im-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,369],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ages of gay subcultural “lifestyles.” These images collapse icons and ele-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,355],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ments of various sexual subcultures into a nexus that links homosexual-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ity, transsexualism, female impersonation, perversion, and killing.","dir":"ltr","width":286,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,442,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"Basic","dir":"ltr","width":22,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,445,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Instinct","dir":"ltr","width":33,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,189,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"also displays confusion regarding the sexual subculture it pur-","dir":"ltr","width":275,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,193,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ports to reference, although one might argue that this movie does not","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"deal with being gay as a subcultural phenomenon, but rather isolates the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"lesbians/bisexuals, so that one does not have the impression of a culture","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"that supports them at all.","dir":"ltr","width":109,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,257],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Amy Taubin makes an argument about how and why serial killer","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,243],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"stories are so popular in the United States:","dir":"ltr","width":189,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,229],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"With just 5% of the world’s population, the US is believed to have about","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,197],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"75% of the world’s serial killers.","dir":"ltr","width":127,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,184],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Disturbing as these figures are, the fact is that the number of people","dir":"ltr","width":276,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,180,171],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"who will die at the hands of serial killers doesn’t even bear comparison","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,158],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"with, for example, the number of women who will die because they","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,145],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,216,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Cultural Studies, Popular Culture, and Pedagogy","dir":"ltr","width":191,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,216,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,299,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"| 26 |","dir":"ltr","width":26,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,299,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false}],"styles":{"g_d2896_f2":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f1":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.72,"descent":-0.245,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f3":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false}},"lang":null}